<blockquote>
<p><strong>Not an LLM.</strong> Resume-to-JD matching is deterministic: TF-IDF cosine
similarity plus skill, experience and education scoring in <code>ATSServiceImpl</code>.
It is reproducible and auditable, which matters for a decision that rejects
candidates.</p>
</blockquote>
