<h1>02 — System Architecture</h1>
<h2>Stack</h2>
<table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="6">
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Concern</th>
<th>Frontend</th>
<th>Backend</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>Core</td>
