</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>interview.service.ts</code></td>
<td>Assign, results, stats, proctoring events, conversation, room verify</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>ai.service.ts</code></td>
<td>Interview start/answer, voice lifecycle, recordings upload, compile</td>
</tr>
<tr>
