</tr>
</tbody></table>
<p>Frontend mirrors live in <code>src/types/</code> — keep them in step when an enum changes.</p>
<h2>Where binary data lives</h2>
<table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="6">
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Data</th>
<th>Storage</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>Profile image</td>
<td>MySQL <code>LONGBLOB</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Resume</td>
<td>MySQL <code>@Lob</code> + <code>contentType</code></td>
</tr>
<tr>
